{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Haphazard Angel",
    "steam_appid": 2363160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Kazfiel Balthioul Tabbris.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, <strong>Kaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game where being an asshole to your friends <strong>is actually a good thing!</strong>\u00a0In Haphazard Angel, 2-4 players take on the hilariously challenging task of controlling a single, magnificent <i>(and often unwieldy)</i> angel. You each control one of its four glorious wings, meaning teamwork is essential... <strong>until it isn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share the Burden, Share the Chaos!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 players</strong> - Grab a  friend and some controllers, you'll have to work together to achieve objectives! Perfect for parties and game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Angel, 4 Wings</strong>\u00a0- Each player controls one wing, but you all share a single body. OUR body. Communication is key\u2014good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Deadly Sins - </strong>Choose a wing inspired by the seven deadly sins. Each one comes with its own strengths and weaknesses\u2014some complement, others clash. Can you make it work?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[STORY MODE]</strong> Stairway to heaven, or highway to hell. <strong>Your destiny awaits.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stripped of your grace and cast into purgatory, you face a monumental choice: <strong>ascend 10,000 meters</strong> of treacherous obstacles on the Stairway to Heaven to reclaim your place, or descend <strong>10,000 meters down</strong> the perilous Highway to Hell in search of\u2026 something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Begin your journey in the murky depths and commit to your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ARCADE MODE]</strong> Several Ways To Win. Find Them All!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperating is a must - </strong>Kaz can't get anywhere with one wing. Collecting halos can get Kaz back to heaven!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competing is inevitable\u00a0</strong>- Only one wing can pick up halos and evil essences. The more each player picks up, the stronger their influence over Kazfiel gets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The controls are simple:</strong> flap your wings, navigate the chaos, and work (or fight) with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re playing couch co-op or online, Haphazard Angel delivers the perfect mix of fun and frustration!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Kazfiel Balthioul Tabbris.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, <strong>Kaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game where being an asshole to your friends <strong>is actually a good thing!</strong>\u00a0In Haphazard Angel, 2-4 players take on the hilariously challenging task of controlling a single, magnificent <i>(and often unwieldy)</i> angel. You each control one of its four glorious wings, meaning teamwork is essential... <strong>until it isn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share the Burden, Share the Chaos!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 players</strong> - Grab a  friend and some controllers, you'll have to work together to achieve objectives! Perfect for parties and game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Angel, 4 Wings</strong>\u00a0- Each player controls one wing, but you all share a single body. OUR body. Communication is key\u2014good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Deadly Sins - </strong>Choose a wing inspired by the seven deadly sins. Each one comes with its own strengths and weaknesses\u2014some complement, others clash. Can you make it work?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[STORY MODE]</strong> Stairway to heaven, or highway to hell. <strong>Your destiny awaits.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stripped of your grace and cast into purgatory, you face a monumental choice: <strong>ascend 10,000 meters</strong> of treacherous obstacles on the Stairway to Heaven to reclaim your place, or descend <strong>10,000 meters down</strong> the perilous Highway to Hell in search of\u2026 something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Begin your journey in the murky depths and commit to your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ARCADE MODE]</strong> Several Ways To Win. Find Them All!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperating is a must - </strong>Kaz can't get anywhere with one wing. Collecting halos can get Kaz back to heaven!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competing is inevitable\u00a0</strong>- Only one wing can pick up halos and evil essences. The more each player picks up, the stronger their influence over Kazfiel gets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.poster.avif?t=1753970666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.webm?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.mp4?t=1753970666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The controls are simple:</strong> flap your wings, navigate the chaos, and work (or fight) with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re playing couch co-op or online, Haphazard Angel delivers the perfect mix of fun and frustration!</p>",
    "short_description": "Team up (or screw over) your friends in Haphazard Angel! Share one angel with your friends and navigate chaotic challenges where cooperation and hilarious sabotage collide in this 2-4 player party game. Who needs teamwork when you\u2019ve got wings and questionable decisions?",
